            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this recipe. Since this only calls for half a head of cabbage like to chop up all the ham and cabbage and divide it in half and throw half in a freezer bag so I can make another pot of soup quickly. Quick and easy and perfect for New Years Day hangover.",
